### CREATE ENTRY
POST http://localhost:3000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "account_id" : "1",
  "multiple_entry_id" : "1",
  "currency": "USD",
  "concept": "Concept 3",
  "date" : "2019-01-01",
  "debit_balance" : "0",
  "credit_balance": "1000",
}

### DESCRIBE USER
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1
Accept: application/json

### LIST ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/users
Accept: */*
Cache-Control: no-cache

### UPDATE USER
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sergio23",
  "password": "123456",
  "email": "test@test.com"
}

### DELETE USER
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/3
